  "text": "\"Ha! Can you believe we actually did it? We made it through the storm, wind howling, rain lashing. I thought we'd never see the sun again.\" \"There were nights.\" \"Knights!\" I cried myself to sleep. \"Whispring! Is anyone even out there?\" \"But then you showed up. You smiled, and suddenly the world wasn't so dark. I felt seen. Understood. Remember that silly dance in the kitchen with the burnt pancakes. Oh, we were a mess. But now, now you're gone. The silence is definite. I miss you. Every single day. But I carry you with me. In every laugh. Every tear. Every quiet moment and I'll keep going because that's what you'd want always.",
